  "tinai": "unknown",
  "sangamTamil": "பொற்கலத் தூட்டிப் புறந்தரினும் நாய்பிறர்\nஎச்சிற் கிமையாது பார்த்திருக்கும் - அச்சீர்\nபெருமை யுடைத்தாக் கொளினுங்கீழ் செய்யும்\nகருமங்கள் வேறு படும்.",
  "urai": null,
  "english": "The dog prefers to feed on refuse. Nature will out! The dog, though you tend it with care, feeding it from a golden vessel, will watch, eye fixed for others' leavings ; even so, although you receive the base as if they were possessed of greatness, the deeds they do will be otherwise (= their real character will be seen by their conduct).",
